{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/9a7d8912f678615cc27b4fab349f9f70.avif?t=1763448459\" width=1080 height=166 /></span><strong>SoulUp</strong> is a <strong>hardcore action adventure</strong> demanding precision and control. It fuses tight combat with the tension of ascending through the skies. <strong>Accuracy</strong>, <strong>focus</strong>, and flawless timing decide whether you live or fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment climbing the tower is <strong>survival</strong>. Combat is a leap to the next stage, and a single mistake means a brutal fall to the depths. Even failure is not the end \u2014 only through <strong>learning from the fall</strong> can your spirit grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/880faa1bbe4aaf4c6713d276bd998c6d.poster.avif?t=1763448459\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/880faa1bbe4aaf4c6713d276bd998c6d.webm?t=1763448459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/880faa1bbe4aaf4c6713d276bd998c6d.mp4?t=1763448459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Platforming Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling is not the end. Master <strong>precision</strong> and <strong>calm judgment</strong> to conquer the tower\u2019s vertical challenges. Each repetition teaches new paths, driving you higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/177847f7e9e2e0956a4cd938cd4663d8.poster.avif?t=1763448459\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/177847f7e9e2e0956a4cd938cd4663d8.webm?t=1763448459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/177847f7e9e2e0956a4cd938cd4663d8.mp4?t=1763448459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Combat Sense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold and lethal combat. Boss battles are merciless. One <strong>attack</strong>, one <strong>dodge</strong>, one <strong>parry</strong> \u2014 each decides survival. Strike with discipline and timing to overcome every threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/fd0677d604099c8a2fc82c4ff436c2f3.poster.avif?t=1763448459\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/fd0677d604099c8a2fc82c4ff436c2f3.webm?t=1763448459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/fd0677d604099c8a2fc82c4ff436c2f3.mp4?t=1763448459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Beyond Limits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SoulUp</strong> tests your focus and mastery. Tension on a narrow platform, painful failure, and the rush of reaching the summit \u2014 all merge into one relentless journey. Can you conquer it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tight, precision-based hardcore combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Vertical tower design combining battle and platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Growth through repeated failure and mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > High difficulty and intense sense of achievement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multilingual UI (Korean, English, Japanese, and more)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131470?t=1763448459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131470?t=1763448459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/5becb2c633f6c0c7bf89557b1aca76ac456496bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763448459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/5becb2c633f6c0c7bf89557b1aca76ac456496bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763448459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/9a7d8912f678615cc27b4fab349f9f70.avif?t=1763448459\" width=1080 height=166 /></span><strong>SoulUp</strong> is a <strong>hardcore action adventure</strong> demanding precision and control. It fuses tight combat with the tension of ascending through the skies. <strong>Accuracy</strong>, <strong>focus</strong>, and flawless timing decide whether you live or fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every moment climbing the tower is <strong>survival</strong>. Combat is a leap to the next stage, and a single mistake means a brutal fall to the depths. Even failure is not the end \u2014 only through <strong>learning from the fall</strong> can your spirit grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 c